TeksAI 1.0.0: Pengesan AI & Humanizer

Lancar: menu aplikasi > TeksAI, atau `teksai` di terminal.
CLI:    teksai detect fail.txt
        teksai humanize fail.txt
Enjin GPT-2 (pilihan): sudo teksai --install-gpt2
Humanizer perlukan kunci API Anthropic (tab Tetapan, atau ANTHROPIC_API_KEY).

Peraturan humanizer: /opt/teksai/humanizer/SKILL.md
  Sumber: https://github.com/blader/humanizer (lesen MIT, lihat /opt/teksai/humanizer/LICENSE)
